      (effects
        (font
          (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)))
  (text "VREF = 2.5 V from TL431 (U603, TO-92). Comparators (LM339N DIP-14, LM393N DIP-8) run from +5 V, open-collector outputs wired-OR onto FAULT_N (pull-up to 3V3)."
    (at 25 212.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 9791c895-3cbf-40dd-b97f-964d468a32fe))
  (text "Trips: OV cell > ~4.29 V | UV cell < ~1.95 V | OC discharge > ~11 A | OC charge > ~6.4 A | heatsink or cell NTC > ~62 C."
    (at 25 216.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 06df12cf-26c0-4f26-8264-3d54b6cf59a6))
  (text "Q601 inverts FAULT_N -> FAULT (active high), which kills the load setpoint, both relay gates and the Peltier driver enable."
    (at 25 221.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 5f96e22a-b9dd-4dcc-93cd-77f21f1882c5))
  (text "The MCU reads FAULT_N on PB15 and can also pull it low (open-drain) to force a safe stop and latch the fault in firmware."
    (at 25 225.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 3875cb5d-3ac5-4ef8-b64a-a81cb15256bd))
  (text "UV also trips with no cell inserted (shows as \"no cell\"). Add ~10 mV hysteresis resistors later if the comparators chatter."
    (at 25 230.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 8f719901-c8da-4a35-b096-cff5bfd6c727))  (text "v0.3 REVIEW NOTES - explained in docs/SCHEMATIC_GUIDE.md section 6; checklist with comment columns in docs/SCHEMATIC_REVIEW.md"
    (at 25 239.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 5c2458bf-d45c-4a36-814b-5f11c1a74512))
  (text "How it works: TL431 = 2.50 V. Six comparators, open collector, wired-OR on FAULT_N. Q601 inverts to FAULT -> Q303 (load), Q205/Q206 (relays), Q701 (BTS7960)."
    (at 25 244.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 9d45bb03-45ee-40eb-a38d-c3fdf077ccae))
  (text "Trips: OV 4.29 V, UV 1.95 V, OC +11.25 A / -6.39 A, heatsink and cell NTC 61.5 C."
    (at 25 248.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 2cbd3388-7d75-4aa4-92b2-93b7086330f0))
  (text "CHECK X-01: OV/UV measure SENSE_P vs GND, not SENSE_N (OV drops to ~4.24 V at 5 A charge).  X-03: no hysteresis."
    (at 25 253.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 133dcf6b-8ae1-4633-8d0c-9c9928475a6f))
)
